"n\">N</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sub_is_def_v3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sub_is_def_v3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">app</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abs_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sub_is_def_v3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs_1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abs_2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sub_is_def_v3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abs_3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sub_is_def_v3</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs_3</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ih_4</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>For example, <code>case abs_3 y_ P_ x_ N_ ih_1 ih_2 ih_3 ih_4</code> versus <code>case abs_3 y_ P_ ih_1 ih_2 ih_3 ih_4</code>. Is this expected? Why?</p>",
